WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:09.120
This is Ghosted. Your base resume is the full record of your work, at any length.

2
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:14.453
Every job gets its own one-page version, cut from it. Spot something off?

3
00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:18.070
Click that line, and the edit form opens right on it.

4
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.647
Or ask for a change in the chat.

5
00:00:22.647 --> 00:00:26.420
It comes back in yellow, and nothing sticks until you keep it.

6
00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:34.033
Each job keeps its own one-page copy of your resume. Let's open one.

7
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.600
Before you apply, Fit shows how you match: what's strong, what to lead with, and the gaps to prepare.

8
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:46.642
Research lists what to read first, with links.

9
00:00:46.642 --> 00:00:51.030
And the chip up top is the ghost's guess at whether anyone's really hiring.

10
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.226
When it's ready, download the PDF, named after the role.

11
00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:02.420
Ask the chat for a cover letter or your answers.

12
00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:07.010
Then set the job to Applied, and Ghosted will nudge you if they go quiet.
